# backtest*.json and judgments*.json are kept: they are the evidence for the
# README's numbers, they carry only public draft titles and generated prose,
# and a claim nobody can re-derive is not a claim. judgments*.json in
# particular lets anyone run scripts/compare_paths.py -- and see that the model
# changed no decision -- without an API key and without paying for a run.
